<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Felcor Suite added.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Felcor Suite added.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said on Thursday that it has added FelCor Suite Hotels to its Focus List.</p>
<p>The Focus List is a list of no more than 30 stocks that offer potential gains with minimal risks that are picked by PaineWebber's analysts.</p>
</text>
